ing the flesh Le 19:28; 21:1-5; De 14:1; Jer 16:6,7; 41:5"},{"r":"LEV.21.1","e":"Priests prohibited, except for the nearest of kin Le 21:1-11"},{"r":"NUM.19.11","e":"Caused ceremonial defilement Nu 19:11-16; 31:19; Le 21:1"},{"r":"NUM.20.29","e":"The Israelites mourned for Aaron for thirty days Nu 20:29"},{"r":"ZEC.12.12","e":"Sexes separated in Zec 12:12,14"}]}